# Providence death commiseration (roadmap D2.2) — dark-corporate-comforting flavor. Rare on purpose
# (see ProvidenceCommiserationGate); private popup shown to the player who just died, one of these
# picked at random. Never gameplay-affecting, never blocks/replaces ahelp or admin bwoink.

solreign-providence-commiseration-1 = Asset status: decommissioned. Solreign extends its condolences, and a complimentary moment of silence not to exceed ten seconds.
solreign-providence-commiseration-2 = Your bioform has been marked temporarily unavailable for productivity. Grief counseling is available upon request; requests are logged for quality assurance.
solreign-providence-commiseration-3 = Cellular activity: null. Please know your contributions will be remembered in next quarter's report, filed under acceptable losses.
solreign-providence-commiseration-4 = You have been involuntarily reassigned to Inactive Status. Solreign values your sacrifice and, more importantly, your continued silence about it.
solreign-providence-commiseration-5 = A moment of appropriate corporate sorrow has been pre-budgeted on your behalf. Please enjoy it before returning to the labor pool.
solreign-providence-commiseration-6 = Vital signs: none detected. Bereavement leave remains unavailable to the deceased, but is, as always, deeply felt.
solreign-providence-commiseration-7 = Your employment has concluded ahead of schedule. Solreign considers this a growth opportunity — for someone else.
solreign-providence-commiseration-8 = Termination notice: literal. Solreign's thoughts are with you, filed under Miscellaneous.
